{"seq":3,"slug":"attention-mlp-roles","title":"注意力与MLP的角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mechanistic-interpretability/circuits/attention-mlp-roles","wordCount":1387,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"注意力与mlp的角色\">注意力与MLP的角色</h1><p>把 Transformer 的一层拆开，里面只有两种计算单元：注意力和 MLP。一个反复被验证的分工直觉是——注意力负责&quot;搬运&quot;，MLP 负责&quot;记忆&quot;。当 Anthropic 在 2025 年的归因图里追踪&quot;Dallas 激活 Texas、Texas 激活 United States、最终激活 Washington D.C.&quot;这条链时，搬运概念的是注意力，而存储&quot;Dallas 在 Texas&quot;这条事实的，是 MLP。理解这条分工线，你才知道面对真实模型时该去哪一类组件里找你要的计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>注意力</strong>（attention）在位置之间移动信息：它把别处的内容按相关性加权后搬到当前位置，本身不&quot;创造&quot;新事实，只重新分配已有信息。<strong>MLP</strong>（多层感知机，逐位置的前馈层）则在单个位置内做非线性变换，被广泛建模为一座<strong>键值记忆库</strong>——前一层权重充当&quot;键&quot;去匹配输入模式，后一层权重充当&quot;值&quot;写出对应内容。</p>\n<p>下图对照两类组件在一次前向中的角色：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  RS1[残差流: 当前位置] --&gt; ATT[注意力&lt;br/&gt;从别的位置搬信息来]&#10;  OTHER[其他位置的信息] --&gt; ATT&#10;  ATT --&gt; RS2[残差流: 信息已汇聚]&#10;  RS2 --&gt; MLP[MLP / 键值记忆&lt;br/&gt;匹配模式 → 取出事实]&#10;  MEM[权重里存储的事实] --&gt; MLP&#10;  MLP --&gt; RS3[残差流: 事实已写入]\">flowchart TD\n  RS1[残差流: 当前位置] --&gt; ATT[注意力&lt;br/&gt;从别的位置搬信息来]\n  OTHER[其他位置的信息] --&gt; ATT\n  ATT --&gt; RS2[残差流: 信息已汇聚]\n  RS2 --&gt; MLP[MLP / 键值记忆&lt;br/&gt;匹配模式 → 取出事实]\n  MEM[权重里存储的事实] --&gt; MLP\n  MLP --&gt; RS3[残差流: 事实已写入]</pre><p>把两者的分工并列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>注意力</th>\n<th>MLP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主要功能</td>\n<td>跨位置搬运信息</td>\n<td>单位置存储/提取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类比</td>\n<td>路由器 / 搬运工</td>\n<td>键值记忆库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息来源</td>\n<td>其他 token 的位置</td>\n<td>权重里编码的事实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型电路</td>\n<td>归纳头、名字搬运头</td>\n<td>事实回忆、特征检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数占比</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>通常约占全层三分之二</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"注意力-跨位置的搬运工\">注意力：跨位置的搬运工</h2><p>注意力的本质是路由。它从不凭空生成内容——一个注意力头能写进残差流的，只能是它从其他位置读到的信息的线性组合。这正是 <a href=\"circuits-motifs\">电路与模式</a> 里 QK/OV 拆分的意义：QK 决定从哪些位置搬，OV 决定搬来的内容如何变换后写入。归纳头是最纯粹的例子，它几乎只做&quot;把早前的 B 搬到现在&quot;这一件搬运的事，见 <a href=\"induction-heads\">归纳头</a>。</p>\n<p>正因为注意力只搬运不创造，跨 token 的复杂推理往往由多个注意力头接力完成：一个头把主语搬过来，另一个头把它和谓语对齐，第三个头再把结果搬到输出位置。这种接力结构是 2025 年归因图里多跳推理链的骨架，详见 <a href=\"../methods/probing-attribution\">探针与归因</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mlp-模型的键值记忆库\">MLP：模型的键值记忆库</h2><p>如果说注意力是搬运工，MLP 就是仓库。一个广为接受的视角（Geva 等人提出，并被后续工作反复验证）把 MLP 的两层权重读成键值记忆：第一层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的每一行是一个&quot;键&quot;，它与输入做内积、检测某个特征是否出现；激活函数挑出被触发的键；第二层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的对应列是&quot;值&quot;，把该键关联的内容写回残差流。形式上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MLP</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MLP}(x) = W_{\\text{out}}\\,\\sigma(W_{\\text{in}} x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MLP</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，中间的非线性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 让它能存储成千上万条这样的键值对。</p>\n<p>这个视角解释了大量现象。事实回忆（&quot;法国的首都是巴黎&quot;）主要存在 MLP 里，激活补丁实验显示，篡改特定中间层 MLP 的激活就能让模型改口。MLP 也是叠加最严重的地方——海量事实压进有限神经元，单个神经元因此高度多义，见 <a href=\"../foundations/superposition-hypothesis\">叠加假说</a>；这正是 <a href=\"../methods/sparse-autoencoders\">稀疏自编码器 SAE</a> 最常被用来解剖 MLP 的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分工不是绝对的\">分工不是绝对的</h2><p>把&quot;注意力搬运、MLP 记忆&quot;当成铁律会犯错。现实里两者深度耦合：注意力有时也在 OV 回路里做轻量的非线性变换，MLP 也参与跨位置信息的整合（因为它读的残差流已被注意力汇聚过）。更重要的是，真正的算法往往是注意力和 MLP 交替协作的产物——前者把需要的信息聚到一处，后者在该处做记忆查询，结果再被下一层注意力搬走。</p>\n<p>2025 年 Anthropic 用<strong>跨层转码器</strong>（cross-layer transcoder, CLT）替换 MLP 来构造归因图，本质上就是承认 MLP 的计算太纠缠、必须先用可解释的稀疏特征替换它，才能把注意力的搬运链清晰地画出来，详见 <a href=\"../methods/probing-attribution\">探针与归因</a> 与 <a href=\"../practice/interpretability-at-scale\">规模化可解释性</a>（来源：Anthropic, On the Biology of a Large Language Model, transformer-circuits.pub, 2025）。</p>\n<p>读 MLP 的键值记忆视角时，把它和注意力并排写成公式更清楚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>键 / 值 分别在做什么</th>\n<th>是否跨位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>注意力</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>O</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{softmax}(QK^\\top/\\sqrt{d_k})\\,V W_O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1072em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8572em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8172em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1828em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>位置相似度当&quot;路由&quot;，内容按权重搬运</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MLP</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{out}}\\,\\sigma(W_{\\text{in}} x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 行是键、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 列是值</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意力的&quot;键&quot;来自其他 token（动态），MLP 的&quot;键&quot;来自训练好的权重（静态）——这一动一静的分野，正是&quot;搬运 vs 记忆&quot;直觉的数学来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一个 Transformer 层只有两类计算单元：注意力负责跨位置搬运，MLP 负责单位置的记忆存取。</li>\n<li>注意力只搬运不创造，复杂推理由多个头接力完成，这是归因图里多跳链的骨架。</li>\n<li>MLP 可读成键值记忆库——键检测特征、值写出内容，事实回忆主要存于此，也是叠加最严重处。</li>\n<li>分工不绝对：两者深度耦合、交替协作；2025 年用跨层转码器替换 MLP，正是为了解开这种纠缠。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"circuits-motifs\">电路与模式</a>、<a href=\"induction-heads\">归纳头</a>、<a href=\"../methods/sparse-autoencoders\">稀疏自编码器 SAE</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/superposition-hypothesis\">叠加假说</a>、<a href=\"../methods/probing-attribution\">探针与归因</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：前馈层与注意力的结构基础见 <a href=\"../../llm-fundamentals/\">LLM 基础</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"注意力与MLP的角色","id":"注意力与mlp的角色"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"注意力：跨位置的搬运工","id":"注意力-跨位置的搬运工"},{"level":2,"text":"MLP：模型的键值记忆库","id":"mlp-模型的键值记忆库"},{"level":2,"text":"分工不是绝对的","id":"分工不是绝对的"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"归纳头","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mechanistic-interpretability/circuits/induction-heads"},"next":{"title":"稀疏自编码器 SAE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mechanistic-interpretability/methods/sparse-autoencoders"}}